1
00:00:00,688 --> 00:00:03,988
(Raj:)seemed like a chance
to show off.

2
00:00:06,360 --> 00:00:08,240
There he is!

3
00:00:08,245 --> 00:00:10,415
(Raj:)There's my happy
Hebraic homeboy.

4
00:00:10,414 --> 00:00:11,914
(Raj:)Yeah, that's the smile
I'm gonna remember

5
00:00:11,916 --> 00:00:16,366
(Raj:)when you're living in the desert
and I'm living with your wife.

6
00:00:20,257 --> 00:00:22,257
(Beverley:)So, what do you do for a living?

7
00:00:23,044 --> 00:00:25,214
(Randall:)Mommy, you want
to take this one?

8
00:00:26,130 --> 00:00:28,550
(Susan:)Um, Randall's
in between jobs.

9
00:00:28,549 --> 00:00:31,349
(Randall:)And court appearances.

10
00:00:32,219 --> 00:00:33,219
(Wyatt:)It's nice to meet the woman

11
00:00:33,220 --> 00:00:35,440
(Wyatt:)who raised this fine young man.

12
00:00:35,439 --> 00:00:37,189
(Wyatt:)I'm looking forward
to meeting his father.

13
00:00:37,191 --> 00:00:39,641
(Beverley:)Prepare to be disappointed.

14
00:00:40,528 --> 00:00:41,698
(Leonard:)And he can't wait
to meet you, too.

15
00:00:41,696 --> 00:00:43,066
(Leonard:)Can I get anyone a drink?

16
00:00:43,064 --> 00:00:44,484
(Wyatt:)Well, I could use
another beer.

17
00:00:44,482 --> 00:00:45,562
(Susan:)You're done.

18
00:00:47,868 --> 00:00:49,148
(Susan:)He's done.

19
00:00:50,654 --> 00:00:53,284
Hey! Is everyone getting
to know each other?

20
00:00:53,290 --> 00:01:05,020
Not at all!

